    "Veo 3.1 Lite and Fast generations and extends cost the same at 4 s, 6 s and 8 s; 4 s and 6 s are Ultra-only. Quality is 8 s only and has no Ultra discount.",
    "Veo 3.1 Lite lower priority is 0 credits (unlimited) on the $199.99 Ultra plan only; on every other plan it prices as Lite.",
    "Omni 1.1 Flash carries no Ultra discount. Google lists Omni video edits at 40 credits; the 360p edit price is halved like its generations (estimated).",
    "Upscales to 720p and 1080p are free for every subscriber; 4K costs 50 credits and needs Ultra. Every Flow call still solves a captcha.",
    "Nano Banana stills are included in the subscription (no per-image credits) per useapi.net; Google's page does not price them separately.",
    "useapi.net itself is a flat $15/month subscription outside these cards; captcha solving is ~$0.80-$3.00 per 1,000 solves after 300 free ones, modeled at the upper bound."
  ],
